seg-5d04ff55adbb = Anyone who takes position or time from GNSS (Global Navigation Satellite Systems) is exposed: jamming, spoofing and signal loss reach vehicles, networks, grids and spacecraft alike. The open core shows how exposed, and says which figures are checked.

